{"id":1050604,"chapter_id":1050604,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"眼前的景象开始崩坏，到处都像机器故障一样，闪烁着故障格。","style":3,"background":2148003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"雷温就这样站在中心，世界在她的背后不停地切换。黑白色，办公室，演播室，天台。","style":3,"background":2148003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"它们定格出现，故障，分裂，变换，碎裂，像是在一次次地上演雷温的心理。","style":3,"background":2156003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"content":"雷温……雷温醒醒……！别被这些事情打败！！你知道应该怎么做的！","style":2,"background":2156003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"content":"她不能做到的，但你能做到！","style":2,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我能做什么呢……我应该怎么做呢……我以为从那样的世界里挣扎出来之后……这个世界就会变得不一样……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我们有一样的压抑，一样的热忱，一样的崩溃和绝望……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_2"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2148003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"speaker":"雷温","content":"她还存在在这里的理由，就是对于这份工作的热爱，是对于那些弥足珍贵的，与她交心的听众……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_3"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2148003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"雷温","content":"她明明真的有给那些人带去帮助，有把自己的热爱散播出去……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2147003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"speaker":"雷温","content":"可最后还是被摧毁……被套上模板，成为虚假的表演……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2147003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"天台的景象定格在雷温的身后，刺骨的风吹来，没有星星的夜晚就这样出现在了你们的面前。","style":3,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我受不了了……被压榨，被欺骗，没有人用真实的一面对待我……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604012,"trial_step":12},{"step":13,"speaker":"雷温","content":"这些情绪像没有办法消灭一样，不停地死而复生，无论我用什么手段，无论我找了谁来帮忙。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_8"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604013,"trial_step":13},{"step":14,"content":"雷温的声音渐渐和另一个声音重合，它们很相似，但你听得出不同。","style":3,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604014,"trial_step":14},{"step":15,"content":"你是真正的鬼来电……？","style":2,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604015,"trial_step":15},{"step":16,"content":"雷温确实和你很像，但她不是你，她也不想成为你。","style":2,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604016,"trial_step":16},{"step":17,"content":"雷温，让我过去。","style":2,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604017,"trial_step":17},{"step":18,"content":"那禁锢一般的空气墙还围绕在你的身边，雷温开始把自己和那个可怜的幽魂合在一起，开始认为自己和她一样。","style":3,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604018,"trial_step":18},{"step":19,"content":"枷锁自你掌心蔓延开来，附着在空中，展开成巨大的荆棘墙。","style":3,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604019,"trial_step":19},{"step":20,"content":"雷温没有理会你的请求，她还在朝天台的边缘走去。那台老式终端从她手中滑落，掉在地上。","style":3,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604020,"trial_step":20},{"step":21,"content":"指示灯颤抖了几下，夹杂着电流的声音，幽幽地从里面传出。","style":3,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604021,"trial_step":21},{"step":22,"content":"雷温，想起那些话来！你难道就甘心，真的变成第二个鬼来电吗！","style":2,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604022,"trial_step":22},{"step":23,"content":"你们相似的只是那份热忱，那份喜欢，不是其他的——","style":2,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604023,"trial_step":23},{"step":24,"content":"一步，一步。","style":3,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604024,"trial_step":24},{"step":25,"content":"终于，雷温站在低矮的围墙上，纵身一跃——","style":3,"background":2153003,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604025,"trial_step":25},{"step":26,"speaker":"雷温","content":"……？","style":1,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604028,"trial_step":28},{"step":27,"content":"这可是我第二次救你了，雷温。","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604029,"trial_step":29},{"step":28,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我为什么……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604030,"trial_step":30},{"step":29,"content":"我们已经失去了那位充满热爱的朋友，我可不想再失去第二个。","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604031,"trial_step":31},{"step":30,"content":"你的位置距离雷温不过几步路，冲过来时，把那台老式终端也踢了过来。","style":3,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604032,"trial_step":32},{"step":31,"content":"它躺在围墙下，断断续续地，播放起了不知道从哪里找到的声音。","style":3,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604033,"trial_step":33},{"step":32,"speaker":"谜之音A","content":"“哎哎，你有看到今天中午那个热搜吗？”","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_29"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":11,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604034,"trial_step":34},{"step":33,"speaker":"谜之音B","content":"“看到了！不要定义自信的自己，好厉害啊！”","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":11,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604035,"trial_step":35},{"step":34,"speaker":"谜之音C","content":"“不过她的电台好像总是有奇怪的电话打进来，还是算了吧，别去凑热闹。”","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_31"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":11,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604036,"trial_step":36},{"step":35,"content":"你看，你的声音，其实还是传达到了他们的心中。","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604037,"trial_step":37},{"step":36,"content":"但如果……你再不做些什么来，你可就亲手把他们又推开了。","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604038,"trial_step":38},{"step":37,"content":"你真的希望这样的事发生吗？你其实……爱着这份工作的吧？","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604039,"trial_step":39},{"step":38,"content":"被你和枷锁抓住的手渐渐地紧握成拳，你的余光中看到那台老式终端和天台，在一点点地化成粉末消散，露出纯白的光。","style":3,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604040,"trial_step":40},{"step":39,"content":"不过，现在当务之急……","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604041,"trial_step":41},{"step":40,"content":"这里是你所主导的世界，如果那份力量回归到了你的身上，能不能先让它把你拉上来先……","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604042,"trial_step":42},{"step":41,"content":"我快支撑不住了……","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604043,"trial_step":43},{"step":42,"content":"歘的一声，所有的画面顿时化为粉末，你和雷温就这样被托着，轻柔地放在了地面上。","style":3,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604044,"trial_step":44},{"step":43,"content":"而自那终端之中，粉末飘过，一颗冒着黑色雾气的小球向雷温飘来。","style":3,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604045,"trial_step":45},{"step":44,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我找了你好久啊……原来你只有这么一点点大吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_41"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604046,"trial_step":46},{"step":45,"speaker":"雷温","content":"那你还真是厉害呢，不管怎么做，似乎都没办法让你真正的消失……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_42"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604047,"trial_step":47},{"step":46,"content":"小球跳动了一下，慢慢地没入了雷温的心口中。","style":3,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604048,"trial_step":48},{"step":47,"speaker":"雷温","content":"狂厄力量……居然会带来这种，让人振奋的感觉吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604049,"trial_step":49},{"step":48,"content":"我想应该不会吧……","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604050,"trial_step":50},{"step":49,"content":"据我所知，世界上应该只有一种东西，无论怎么折磨，怎么打压，用什么手段，都销毁不了。","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604051,"trial_step":51},{"step":50,"content":"而且也能带来振奋的感觉。","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604052,"trial_step":52},{"step":51,"speaker":"雷温","content":"那……是什么呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_48"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604053,"trial_step":53},{"step":52,"content":"“成长”和“蜕变”，对于自己各方面而言的成长……它会鼓励你，振奋你，让你……还愿意走下去。","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604054,"trial_step":54},{"step":53,"content":"我想，这些难缠的力量，或许是不甘心吧。","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604055,"trial_step":55},{"step":54,"content":"——你从那个世界回来后，肯定已经发现了，这个环境并没有因为你找回初心而变得更好吧，所以就想着要销毁凌晨三点的来电的一切痕迹了？","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604056,"trial_step":56},{"step":55,"speaker":"雷温","content":"是啊……我以为……它们还是不存在的比较好。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_52"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604057,"trial_step":57},{"step":56,"content":"你内心的声音，肯定不是这么想的。","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604058,"trial_step":58},{"step":57,"content":"否则，我真的能靠这几句话，就把你从天台上扯下来吗？","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604059,"trial_step":59},{"step":58,"content":"雷温释然一笑，撑着身体站了起来，此时，你竟然好像在她的脸上，看到了当时在异世界，见到的那位“电话幽灵”。","style":3,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604060,"trial_step":60},{"step":59,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我心底的声音……当然不是这么想的，但我确实不会再在这里工作了。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604061,"trial_step":61},{"step":60,"speaker":"雷温","content":"所以，局长，谢谢你——以及，我有件事情，想要局长帮忙。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604062,"trial_step":62},{"step":61,"content":"有什么事情回局里再说吧，我们都累了。","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604063,"trial_step":63},{"step":62,"content":"哦对了，我刚才看到你的口袋还有东西，那个三明治，记得吃啊。","style":2,"background":2153,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604064,"trial_step":64},{"step":63,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"局长，您交代的事情已经差不多完成了。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604065,"trial_step":65},{"step":64,"content":"啊，感谢你，你总是那么的靠谱。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604066,"trial_step":66},{"step":65,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"关于最后一个异常世界的处理工作。目前已确认禁闭者雷温能力恢复无恙，同时M值检测结果稳定。后续如果没有其他污点记录的话，可以申请降低监控等级。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_62"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604067,"trial_step":67},{"step":66,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"以及在管理局让雷温做最后一场电台节目的批准也下来了，尽管电视台那边其实并不愿意继续承认雷温是他们的主播，但他们认为这件事有足够的噱头，于是看在您的面子上答应了。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_63"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604068,"trial_step":68},{"step":67,"content":"她拿出一叠文件，摆在你的面前。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604069,"trial_step":69},{"step":68,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"只不过，他们给出了诸多需求，这些文件，都得您过目签名才可以。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604070,"trial_step":70},{"step":69,"content":"好吧，让我看看，需要我签多少卖身契……有没有什么空子可以钻钻的……","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604071,"trial_step":71},{"step":70,"speaker":"雷温","content":"这么快？我以前向上面申请个什么东西，基本都要一两个星期才好……看来你的面子挺大的。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604072,"trial_step":72},{"step":71,"content":"当你告知，雷温之前的请求已经批准了，雷温显得有点惊讶。","style":3,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604073,"trial_step":73},{"step":72,"options":["我到底是个“局长”"],"style":6,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604074,"trial_step":74,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"我到底是个“局长”","goto":75}]},{"step":73,"content":"马上到了，前面那个房间就是。","style":2,"background":1020,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604075,"trial_step":75},{"step":74,"content":"你推开门。房间非常普通，只有最基础的桌椅，唯一不同的是桌面上——那里放着一套十分简易的录音装置。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604076,"trial_step":76},{"step":75,"content":"但这也是我能做到的极限了，设备基本都是最简陋的，希望你不要嫌弃。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604077,"trial_step":77},{"step":76,"speaker":"雷温","content":"不！很感谢你！这样就足够了，我的电台……本来最重要的，就只有我的声音而已。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604078,"trial_step":78},{"step":77,"content":"雷温很开心，她向你点头道谢后，轻轻落座在话筒前。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604079,"trial_step":79},{"step":78,"content":"其实他们一开始也在犹豫要不要批准，但作为《凌晨三点的来电》的最后一场道别，还是有很大的噱头的。而且他们提了几个要求：一，必须得保证你一直处于MBCC的监管之下。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604080,"trial_step":80},{"step":79,"content":"二、不能再使用能力，并且接听电话，也得由他们筛选。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604081,"trial_step":81},{"step":80,"speaker":"雷温","content":"第三点呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_77"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604082,"trial_step":82},{"step":81,"content":"三，作为MBCC局长的你必须签署一份份担保协议，你花了三天才签完那些冗长的文书。显然，现在不是个适合诉苦的时候。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604083,"trial_step":83},{"step":82,"content":"第三点——就是由我本人亲自作为导播，监督最后一期节目的录制。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604084,"trial_step":84},{"step":83,"content":"这期节目没有脚本。报复也好，告别也好，只要在“我认为”符合规范的前提下，随你心情。如果你不愿意，我们也可以随时离开这里。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604085,"trial_step":85},{"step":84,"content":"你将选择的权力彻底交给雷温。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604086,"trial_step":86},{"step":85,"speaker":"雷温","content":"好的，谢谢你。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_82"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604087,"trial_step":87},{"step":86,"content":"雷温露出狡黠的笑容——她听懂了你的“言外之意”。管理局的标准，可比电视台的“标准”，要宽松不少。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604088,"trial_step":88},{"step":87,"content":"你顺势坐在主持人对面的椅子上，向她眨眨眼。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604089,"trial_step":89},{"step":88,"content":"当然，如果有什么过激行为，我会及时出来制止的。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604090,"trial_step":90},{"step":89,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我知道的。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_86"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604091,"trial_step":91},{"step":90,"speaker":"雷温","content":"啊——嗯，咳咳……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_87"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604092,"trial_step":92},{"step":91,"content":"调试过声带的状态后，雷温念起熟悉的开场词。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604093,"trial_step":93},{"step":92,"speaker":"雷温","content":"“或许你已经结束一天的忙碌，又或许还在回味今日的疲惫。”","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_89"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604094,"trial_step":94},{"step":93,"speaker":"雷温","content":"“欢迎来到最后一期凌晨三点的来电，我是主持人雷温。”","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_90"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604095,"trial_step":95},{"step":94,"content":"她的声音依旧平稳而甜美，但桌面上的双手已经紧紧攥在一起。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604096,"trial_step":96},{"step":95,"speaker":"雷温","content":"这是一期本不该存在的特别节目。凌晨三点是倾听的时间，但机会难得，我想先分享一个朋友的故事。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_92"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604097,"trial_step":97},{"step":96,"speaker":"雷温","content":"她……是个软弱的人。自己的声音不够坚定，不仅容易被周遭的言论影响，还带来了巨大的麻烦。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_93"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604098,"trial_step":98},{"step":97,"speaker":"雷温","content":"在另一个朋友的帮助下，她终于找回了自己的声音。但只有她自己知道，她还是不够坚强，她害怕再去触碰他人的心声，努力之后发现事情依旧没有变好，就开始退缩了。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_94"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604099,"trial_step":99},{"step":98,"speaker":"雷温","content":"她……甚至想要毁掉自己的喜欢……这样软弱的人，还有什么价值呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_95"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604100,"trial_step":100},{"step":99,"content":"雷温的声音软软的，很轻柔，听上去毫无攻击力，只是……","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604101,"trial_step":101},{"step":100,"content":"（空场+电话铃响）","style":18,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604102,"trial_step":102},{"step":101,"speaker":"雷温","content":"啊，来电已经接进来了，让我们先来听听，听众们的声音吧。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_98"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604103,"trial_step":103},{"step":102,"speaker":"听众A","content":"喂？请问是雷温小姐吗？太好了，你停播后我找了你好久，可算找到了！","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_99"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":11,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604104,"trial_step":104},{"step":103,"speaker":"雷温","content":"十分感谢，但这已经是最后一期节目了，我——","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_100"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604105,"trial_step":105},{"step":104,"speaker":"听众A","content":"你不知道你不在我有多无聊！我还以为你玩不起呢！不就是骂了你几句吗，就开始玩失踪了！","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_101"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":11,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604106,"trial_step":106},{"step":105,"speaker":"听众A","content":"现在还用最后一期节目来赚噱头！嘿！那我可不得打进来……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_102"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":11,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604107,"trial_step":107},{"step":106,"speaker":"雷温","content":"打进来做什么呢？继续靠辱骂他人获得成就感吗？想要一个任打任骂还不还手的沙袋吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_103"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604108,"trial_step":108},{"step":107,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我用声音温柔地对待每一个人，是想要以这样的方式互相交流，而不是作为一个柔软的玩偶，承受你们暴力的言语带来的伤痛，供你们发泄。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_104"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604109,"trial_step":109},{"step":108,"speaker":"雷温","content":"希望您下次再给电台打电话，接听的不是女鬼。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_105"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604110,"trial_step":110},{"step":109,"speaker":"听众A","content":"你！！！","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_106"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":11,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604111,"trial_step":111},{"step":110,"content":"听筒那端的人愣了很久，一句话也说不出来，直接把电话给挂了，但下一个电话已经马不停蹄地接通进来了。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604112,"trial_step":112},{"step":111,"speaker":"听众B","content":"嘿，接听了！喂，我问你，听众可是你的衣食父母！你这什么态度啊？","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_108"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":11,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604113,"trial_step":113},{"step":112,"speaker":"雷温","content":"您是什么态度对我，我将以什么态度来对待您呀。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_109"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604114,"trial_step":114},{"step":113,"content":"雷温的笑容愈发温柔，你突然有点可惜，雷温不是露面的主播，真想让那些人也看看雷温现在“温柔”的笑容。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604115,"trial_step":115},{"step":114,"speaker":"听众B","content":"你这不是电视台的完美主播吗？这有什么完美的！连听众的要求都做不到！","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_111"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":11,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604116,"trial_step":116},{"step":115,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我只会听正常的，合理的需求，心情好的时候或许会允许出格一点点，但听不听，取决于我，不是你。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_112"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604117,"trial_step":117},{"step":116,"speaker":"雷温","content":"让别人遵守你的要求之前，先看看自己能不能达到吧，完美的听众。如果你连我这点话都承受不住，又怎么去承受生活中更多的苦痛呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_113"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604118,"trial_step":118},{"step":117,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我知道你们这些人喜欢什么刺激，既然“无法还嘴”的感受在工作和生活上体验得还不够，又或者还没体验过的话，欢迎来雷温的电台，体验一番这别出心裁的蹂躪节目吧~","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_114"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604119,"trial_step":119},{"step":118,"speaker":"听众B","content":"￥%%……&￥*&……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_115"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":11,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604120,"trial_step":120},{"step":119,"speaker":"雷温","content":"——放心，这样的节目照样会上热搜的！","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_116"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604121,"trial_step":121},{"step":120,"content":"一个又一个，曾经的、看热闹的、电台的听众的通话连进来，向雷温传递他们的“心意”与“祝福”，雷温也一次次地回复着对方的话语。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604122,"trial_step":122},{"step":121,"content":"电台那边并没有掐断任何一通来电，你叹了口气——你知道他们肯定会以流量为上，现在的雷温也肯定能左右这场流量游戏。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604123,"trial_step":123},{"step":122,"content":"看着热搜榜上不断出现的相关信息，你轻声笑了笑，坐下来，用独立线路打了过去——这些电话让雷温的狂厄能力有些不稳定，你是时候出面了。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604124,"trial_step":124},{"step":123,"options":["把电话放在耳边"],"style":6,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604125,"trial_step":125,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"把电话放在耳边","goto":126}]},{"step":124,"content":"晚上好，主持人，请问您能听听我的烦恼吗？","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604126,"trial_step":126},{"step":125,"speaker":"雷温","content":"……当然，我很乐意倾听你的声音。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_122"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604127,"trial_step":127},{"step":126,"content":"咳咳……首先我向你道歉。这通电话，其实我是动用了自己的“权力”，才抢了进来的，不过放心，它并不会被对外播放，这是管理局的内线，","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604128,"trial_step":128},{"step":127,"content":"作为管理局局长，我需要约束所有禁闭者的行为。但作为朋友，我希望你能够坦然地，健康地，好好地成长，好好地去爱着什么。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604129,"trial_step":129},{"step":128,"speaker":"雷温","content":"所以……你是愿意相信，其实我真的还喜爱着这份工作吗？","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_125"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604130,"trial_step":130},{"step":129,"options":["当然愿意。"],"style":6,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604131,"trial_step":131,"course":3,"choices":[{"text":"当然愿意。","goto":132}]},{"step":130,"content":"毕竟工作这玩意儿，或许就是大多数人在不甘心就这么死去之前，对改变这个世界做出的一点点小小的反抗。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604132,"trial_step":132},{"step":131,"content":"一点小小的自我实现。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604133,"trial_step":133},{"step":132,"content":"你所发声的，你所反抗的，看着好像很不珍惜自己的羽翼，自己的工作，也很像在炒作。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604134,"trial_step":134},{"step":133,"speaker":"雷温","content":"但……这是我爱着它的证明——你已经让我学会了很多，有所成长。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_130"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604135,"trial_step":135},{"step":134,"speaker":"雷温","content":"既然这个环境还没有变好，那就让成长、蜕变了的我，来进行一些改变吧！我想，这也是我的“力量”想要做到的。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_131"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604136,"trial_step":136},{"step":135,"content":"确实，这也是他们希望看到的。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604137,"trial_step":137},{"step":136,"content":"尽管那些热搜词条下，依旧是谩骂更多，但不难发现，里面有许多讨论是和他们的声音不一样的。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604138,"trial_step":138},{"step":137,"content":"他们感谢雷温的声音，这给他们带来了力量，带来了勇气，带来了改变的动力。也感谢雷温，让他们也愿意去反抗那些恶意的声音。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604139,"trial_step":139},{"step":138,"speaker":"雷温","content":"在这之后，我肯定没办法再回去当这个主播了，只不过，我相信，会有更优秀的人，出现在这个岗位上的。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_135"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604140,"trial_step":140},{"step":139,"speaker":"雷温","content":"但是……既然这个环境一定会有阴暗面，那我何不继续做这个“凌晨三点的来电”呢？","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_136"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604141,"trial_step":141},{"step":140,"content":"嗯？看样子，你是想到了关于之后有什么打算……啊，但前提是，你得留在这儿接受收容。","style":2,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604142,"trial_step":142},{"step":141,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我知道的，局长。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_138"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604143,"trial_step":143},{"step":142,"content":"雷温的手指轻抚上麦克风，看着那些热搜下的内容。","style":3,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604144,"trial_step":144},{"step":143,"speaker":"雷温","content":"那些真实的，有力量有情感的温暖声音——我最爱的声音，其实一直在这。谢谢你把它们重新带回来，送给我，让我明白它们蕴含的力量。","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_140"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604145,"trial_step":145},{"step":144,"speaker":"雷温","content":"我也很贪婪，我想要继续听到这样的声音……","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_141"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604146,"trial_step":146},{"step":145,"speaker":"雷温","content":"这档关于语言的蹂躏节目既然已经上了热搜……那它一定有了继续办下去的底气吧？","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_142"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":2155,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604147,"trial_step":147},{"step":146,"speaker":"雷温","content":"“或许你已经结束一天的忙碌，又或许还在回味今日的疲惫与责罚……”","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_144"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604149,"trial_step":149},{"step":147,"speaker":"雷温","content":"“别着急……亲爱的，凌晨三点的来电将会永远留在夜晚陪伴您。”","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_145"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604150,"trial_step":150},{"step":148,"speaker":"“想去了+1”","content":"“感谢大家一直以来对凌晨三点的来电的支持。这不是告别，而是重逢的约定。“","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_146"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604151,"trial_step":151},{"step":149,"speaker":"雷温","content":"“夜色无尽，灯火幽暗。我会永远留在这里……倾听你们的声音。”","voice":["vo_trial_50604_1_147"],"voice_bank":"vo_eleven_trial","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1,"src_id":150604152,"trial_step":152}]}